{"id":42094,"ord":184,"n_segments":278,"prev":42093,"next":42095,"doc":{"id":"52043","title":"52043_Herman Autrey oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Herman Autrey","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/52043/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52043"},"chapter":"Hopkins, the South and Stuff Smith","title":"His marriages: Pet, Elizabeth Radcliffe and Mary","category":"health_personal","summary":"His first wife died in 1934 or 1935; he married Mary in the Bronx around 1936-37; before that Pet was the first partner and Elizabeth, now living in Washington, the second wife.","period":"1927-37","year_from":1927,"year_to":1927,"words":331,"start":[299,9],"end":[302,12],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=52043#s42094","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Bronx","focus":1,"type":"neighborhood","in":"New York"},{"name":"Washington, D.C.","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"California","focus":0,"type":"state"}],"venues":[{"name":"Trouville Club","focus":0,"city":"Hollywood"}],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Elizabeth Radcliffe","qid":null,"n":7},{"name":"Mary Autrey","qid":null,"n":4},{"name":"Herman Autrey","qid":"Q337965","n":2},{"name":"Pet Gentry","qid":null,"n":2}],"story":{"theme":43,"theme_name":"Meeting, marrying and raising a family","community":84,"community_name":"Meeting, courting and marrying: musicians' love lives","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":299,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"This reminds me of something, Herman. We've sort of lost track of your marriages, because your wife died when? '34? 1934?"},{"p":299,"b":10,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"'34 or '35."},{"p":299,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"'35."},{"p":299,"b":12,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"That one."},{"p":299,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Okay, but now here you are, we're up"},{"p":300,"b":0,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah. Yeah. Trouville"},{"p":300,"b":1,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": The Truville, and in California."},{"p":300,"b":2,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Oh yeah, (unintelligible) here. We married here in the Bronx too."},{"p":300,"b":3,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": What was her name?"},{"p":300,"b":4,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Mary. She --"},{"p":300,"b":5,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": Oh, this, oh --"},{"p":300,"b":6,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah, she's in the room down there."},{"p":300,"b":7,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": Oh, what -- you were married when?"},{"p":300,"b":8,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Thirty what? Thirty what? Thirty what? '36, '37."},{"p":300,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": Oh, '36 or '37, so shortly after your other wife died that you married Mary. Oh."},{"p":300,"b":10,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah."},{"p":300,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": And you've been married to Mary ever since."},{"p":300,"b":12,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Oh, sure."},{"p":300,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": Oh, I see."},{"p":300,"b":14,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":300,"b":15,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": Well now, when --"},{"p":300,"b":16,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Now -- oh, before -- before that I married a Washington girl."},{"p":300,"b":17,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":": Yeah."},{"p":300,"b":18,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"And she still lives Washington. She's"},{"p":301,"b":0,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"working at the -- what the heck -- out there, uh, the big place there in Washington. She just retired. She (unintelligible.)"},{"p":301,"b":1,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Doing what kind of work? What kind of big place?"},{"p":301,"b":2,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Office work. She's in the --"},{"p":301,"b":3,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Pentagon?"},{"p":301,"b":4,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Pentagon!"},{"p":301,"b":5,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Oh, Pentagon."},{"p":301,"b":6,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah, she had about 25, 30 girls under her."},{"p":301,"b":7,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"What was her name?"},{"p":301,"b":8,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Uh, Elizabeth. She's a Mrs. Elizabeth Turner, now."},{"p":301,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Turner."},{"p":301,"b":10,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah, but she was --"},{"p":301,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Elizabeth What, when you --"},{"p":301,"b":12,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Autrey."},{"p":301,"b":13,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"But I mean before you married her."},{"p":301,"b":14,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Oh, Radcliffe."},{"p":301,"b":15,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Elizabeth Radcliffe when you married her. Was that -- was that your first wife?"},{"p":301,"b":16,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah."},{"p":301,"b":17,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"And then you --"},{"p":301,"b":18,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Well, I mean wife, yeah. Her and me"},{"p":302,"b":0,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"together."},{"p":302,"b":1,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Well, you (don't have to get too it's a technical, problem."},{"p":302,"b":2,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Okay."},{"p":302,"b":3,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"And then you married Pet? Was that -- was she the second one?"},{"p":302,"b":4,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"No, well, we -- what should I say? WE lived together for years."},{"p":302,"b":5,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"I see."},{"p":302,"b":6,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah, she was the first."},{"p":302,"b":7,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Pet was the first."},{"p":302,"b":8,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Yeah."},{"p":302,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"I see, and then --"},{"p":302,"b":10,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"Then Elizabeth, and Mary. And --"},{"p":302,"b":11,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"And then -- ?"},{"p":302,"b":12,"s":"MR. AUTREY","x":"That's it. No more."}]}